  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ぜんしんを　ちぢめ　１００キロの\nすなを　はなの　あなから　ふんしゃ。\nすなが　ないと　よわきに　なるぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "온몸을 수축시킨 뒤 100kg의\n모래를 콧구멍으로 내뿜는다.\n모래가 없으면 무기력해진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "蜷縮身體後從鼻孔裡噴射出\n１００公斤的沙子。沒有了\n沙子就會變得很懦弱。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il peut expulser 100 kg de sable de ses narines\nen compressant tout son corps. Quand il est\nà court de sable, il a tendance à se dérober.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Zieht es seinen ganzen Körper zusammen, kann\nes 100 kg Sand aus seinen Nasenlöchern feuern.\nGeht ihm der Sand aus, verliert es den Mut.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se retuerce para expulsar por los orificios nasales\nhasta 100 kg de arena. La ausencia de esta mina\nsu ánimo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Può rimpicciolire il suo corpo espellendo dalle\nnarici 100 kg di sabbia. Quando esaurisce la\nsabbia, viene preso dallo sconforto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When it contracts its body, over 220 pounds of\nsand sprays from its nose. If it ever runs out of\nsand, it becomes disheartened.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "全身を　縮め　１００キロの\n砂を　鼻の　穴から　噴射。\n砂が　ないと　弱気に　なるぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "蜷缩身体后从鼻孔里喷射出\n１００公斤的沙子。没有了\n沙子就会变得很懦弱。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se retuerce para expulsar por los orificios nasales\nhasta 100 kg de arena. La ausencia de esta mina\nsu ánimo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "どくとくの　とぐろの　まきかたは\nすなぶくろの　すなを　より　こうりつ\nよく　ふんしゃ　するため　なのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "독특한 똬리 형태는\n모래주머니의 모래를 더 효율적으로\n분사하기 위함이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "牠之所以會以獨特的方式\n盤繞自己的身體，是為了能\n更有效率地噴射沙囊中的沙子。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "S’il s’enroule d’une manière aussi particulière,\nc’est pour optimiser l’expulsion de sable\npar ses narines.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es rollt sich auf diese eigentümliche Weise\nzusammen, damit es den Sand aus seinem\nSandbeutel effizienter verschießen kann.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La manera tan particular que tiene de enrollarse\nsobre sí mismo le permite expulsar con mayor\neficacia la arena que almacena en la bolsa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il modo particolare in cui si attorciglia su se\nstesso gli permette di espellere sabbia dalla\nsua sacca in modo più efficiente.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its unique style of coiling allows it to blast sand\nout of its sand sac more efficiently.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "独特の　とぐろの　巻き方は\n砂袋の　砂を　より　効率\nよく　噴射　するため　なのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "它之所以会以独特的方式\n盘绕自己的身体，是为了能\n更高效地喷射砂囊中的沙子。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La manera tan particular que tiene de enrollarse\nsobre sí mismo le permite expulsar con mayor\neficacia la arena que almacena en la bolsa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "からだを　めいっぱい　しんしゅくさせダンプカーも　おしながすほどのいきおいで　すなを　ふんしゃする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "몸을 있는 힘껏 신축시켜서 덤프트럭도 밀어 버릴 정도의 기세로 모래를 분사한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會把身體伸長到極限後，用足以沖走大卡車的氣勢噴射出沙子。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il gonfle puis contracte son corps de toutes ses forces afin d’expulser du sable si violemment qu’il serait capable de déplacer un camion.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wenn es seinen Körper maximal ausdehnt und wieder zusammenzieht, kann es Sand mit einer Wucht abfeuern, die einen Kipplaster hinwegfegt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Estira y contrae su cuerpo al máximo para expulsar arena con tal potencia que puede mover incluso un camión.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Contrae il suo corpo fino all’estremo per poi espellere sabbia con una potenza tale da trascinare via anche un mezzo pesante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It will expand its body as much as it can and then contract itself, blasting out sand with enough force to wash away a dump truck.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "体を　目一杯　伸縮させダンプカーも　押し流すほどの勢いで　砂を　噴射する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会把身体伸展到极限，用足以冲走翻斗车的气势喷射出沙子。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Estira y contrae su cuerpo al máximo para expulsar arena con tal potencia que puede mover incluso un camión.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "はきだす　すなに　まざる　するどくとがった　じゃりは　だえきですなが　いびつに　かたまったものだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "뿜어내는 모래에 섞여 있는 날카롭고 뾰족한 자갈은 침에 의해 모래가 이상하게 굳어진 것이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "牠噴出的沙子裡會混著用唾液凝固沙子後形成的尖銳沙礫，形狀千奇百怪。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le gravier tranchant mélangé au sable qu’il crache est composé de morceaux de sable aux formes irrégulières solidifiés par sa salive.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der von ihm ausgespiene Sand enthält spitzen Kies, bei dem es sich eigentlich um Sand handelt, der durch seinen Speichel erhärtet wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La grava puntiaguda que mezcla con la arena que escupe se forma a partir de arena que ha compactado irregularmente con su saliva.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La ghiaia appuntita che si trova nella sabbia che espelle è in realtà sabbia mista a saliva solidificatasi in forme irregolari.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The sand it spews contains sharp, pointy gravel, which is actually just sand that Sandaconda’s saliva has hardened into irregular shapes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "吐き出す　砂に　混ざる　鋭く尖った　砂利は　唾液で砂が　いびつに　固まったものだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
